WEBVTT

01:18.570 --> 01:21.950
[Love Has Fireworks]

01:21.990 --> 01:24.930
[Episode 13]

01:31.720 --> 01:33.850
[Conference Room]

01:37.820 --> 01:41.039
[Asset Structuring Plan Presentation]

02:30.360 --> 02:32.150
Wake up. Don't sleep here.

02:32.750 --> 02:33.680
Go home to sleep.

02:40.000 --> 02:41.400
Wake up.

02:49.910 --> 02:50.750
Director Li?

02:52.000 --> 02:53.460
Why are you sleeping here?

02:55.590 --> 02:56.470
I worked late,

02:56.500 --> 02:58.230
so I just made do and slept here.

02:59.280 --> 03:00.680
Come on. Go home to sleep.

03:01.870 --> 03:02.730
What time is it?

03:09.370 --> 03:10.400
It's already 5:00.

03:10.400 --> 03:11.030
Forget it.

03:11.310 --> 03:12.740
I'll just make do here.

03:13.000 --> 03:14.400
Work starts soon anyway.

03:14.620 --> 03:15.860
I'll drive you back.

03:16.000 --> 03:17.150
You can take half a day off tomorrow

03:17.150 --> 03:18.480
and get some good sleep.

03:19.430 --> 03:21.110
I appreciate your kindness,

03:21.430 --> 03:23.790
but I work for Director Fang.

03:24.079 --> 03:25.880
I have a presentation tomorrow.

03:26.340 --> 03:28.040
Alright, you should go.

03:28.430 --> 03:29.470
There are cameras here.

03:29.470 --> 03:31.329
People will gossip if they see us.

03:33.079 --> 03:34.240
Crazy.

03:59.920 --> 04:06.980
♪ What matters to me is what you need ♪

04:07.910 --> 04:14.170
♪ Nothing more, nothing less,
I just hope it's something I can give ♪

04:14.890 --> 04:21.200
♪ What I cherish is what I have ♪

04:22.710 --> 04:28.890
♪ Every little moment,
I hope you're there with me ♪

04:29.680 --> 04:33.600
♪ Those fairy tales, sweet words,
and declarations of love ♪

04:33.630 --> 04:36.840
You bite the hand that feeds you.

04:34.340 --> 04:37.750
♪ Are like fireworks
lighting up the night ♪

04:38.159 --> 04:42.310
♪ Truths, lies,
and words said just for show ♪

04:42.920 --> 04:44.800
♪ Feel like I'm walking on cotton ♪

04:45.180 --> 04:49.380
♪ Harsh words, lies,
and words I can't make sense of ♪

04:50.150 --> 04:52.110
♪ Pretentious words wrapped
in glitter and glamour ♪

04:52.510 --> 04:56.620
♪ Dreams, madness,
and the words buried in my heart ♪

04:57.360 --> 05:01.420
♪ Under your fiery eyes ♪

05:06.850 --> 05:11.080
♪ Those fairy tales, sweet words,
and declarations of love ♪

05:10.600 --> 05:16.650
[Shan Li Fang Hotel Group]

05:11.480 --> 05:15.300
♪ Are like fireworks
lighting up the night ♪

05:15.990 --> 05:21.610
♪ Dreams, madness,
and the words buried in my heart ♪

05:20.040 --> 05:20.570
Morning.

05:21.190 --> 05:21.720
Morning.

05:23.480 --> 05:24.610
I brought coffee. Do you want some?

05:24.610 --> 05:25.280
Thank you.

05:26.590 --> 05:27.080
Here.

05:28.540 --> 05:29.800
Here's sugar and milk.

05:38.500 --> 05:39.970
[Conference Room]

05:44.190 --> 05:44.680
This...

05:49.159 --> 05:50.490
Go freshen yourself up.

05:50.670 --> 05:51.659
In 10 minutes,

05:51.750 --> 05:53.480
let's have a meeting to discuss

05:54.000 --> 05:56.190
the proposal you mentioned yesterday.

05:56.190 --> 05:56.870
Okay.

06:39.360 --> 06:40.980
Why didn't you keep a record?

06:41.360 --> 06:42.860
Why did you fall asleep?

06:43.030 --> 06:45.090
Why can't you remember anything now?

06:52.090 --> 06:55.760
[Pantry]

06:58.260 --> 06:59.270
[Pantry]

07:14.870 --> 07:15.580
Are you ready?

07:15.580 --> 07:17.240
If you're ready, let's begin.

07:17.830 --> 07:18.600
Um...

07:19.890 --> 07:21.940
I owe everyone an apology.

07:22.630 --> 07:24.070
The materials I prepared...

07:24.070 --> 07:25.870
-Actually...
-They are with me.

07:26.830 --> 07:27.430
Sorry.

07:27.430 --> 07:28.960
I forgot to give them to you.

07:33.920 --> 07:35.390
While you were preparing just now,

07:35.390 --> 07:36.680
Mr. Li already showed us

07:36.150 --> 07:37.450
[Value Creation] [Risk Control]
[Technological Innovation]

07:36.700 --> 07:38.010
your proposal.

07:38.950 --> 07:40.480
Although it's just a framework,

07:40.480 --> 07:42.540
I'm quite satisfied with it overall.

07:43.000 --> 07:43.480
Not bad.

07:45.390 --> 07:46.190
However,

07:46.340 --> 07:48.400
from the 2nd to the 4th part,

07:48.510 --> 07:50.570
I don't quite understand your ideas.

07:50.630 --> 07:52.909
I still need you to elaborate in detail

07:52.940 --> 07:54.260
on how to implement it.

07:54.630 --> 07:55.570
Okay, no problem.

07:55.570 --> 07:56.950
Then I'll first give everyone
a detailed explanation

07:56.950 --> 07:58.360
about the fourth part.

08:00.720 --> 08:01.480
First of all,

08:01.480 --> 08:02.850
part 4 is actually about

08:03.040 --> 08:05.900
evaluating
the existing internal control system.

08:11.290 --> 08:16.670
[Evaluating
the Existing Internal Control System]

08:27.840 --> 08:29.650
[Internal Control Test]
[Defect Assessment]

08:45.380 --> 08:47.240
Sleeping sprawled out like that.

08:47.240 --> 08:49.170
She doesn't look like a girl at all.

08:51.210 --> 08:52.310
So silly.

08:53.000 --> 08:53.630
Boss.

08:54.150 --> 08:56.390
What are you looking at?
You're smiling so happily.

08:56.390 --> 08:57.790
This was done beautifully.

08:57.790 --> 08:59.090
I'm sending a WeChat message.

08:59.090 --> 09:01.890
These are the documents
that need your signature.

09:03.200 --> 09:03.840
Boss,

09:04.240 --> 09:05.720
you have completely sorted out

09:05.720 --> 09:07.270
the plan to restructure
the financial statements

09:07.270 --> 09:08.870
of Shan Li Fang Hotel Group.

09:08.960 --> 09:10.960
It's much more complete than Qian Fei's.

09:10.960 --> 09:13.090
Why didn't we just use your plan?

09:14.630 --> 09:15.470
Come on.

09:15.600 --> 09:17.560
Am I the kind of person to steal credit?

09:17.560 --> 09:19.150
Making sure this project
progresses smoothly

09:19.150 --> 09:21.790
is much more important
than stealing Qian Fei's credit.

09:21.790 --> 09:22.840
You've been with me for so long,

09:22.840 --> 09:25.170
but you haven't learned any of my virtues.

09:25.630 --> 09:26.670
Alright, stop talking.

09:26.670 --> 09:27.570
Send it out immediately after signing.

09:27.570 --> 09:28.570
Don't waste time.

09:29.730 --> 09:30.360
Understood.

09:30.360 --> 09:30.760
Hold on, hold on.

09:30.760 --> 09:32.620
Knock before you enter next time.

09:32.710 --> 09:33.710
Look at her.

09:43.670 --> 09:44.400
Director Li.

09:44.670 --> 09:46.870
Thank you for the meeting this morning.

09:50.600 --> 09:51.720
Tell me more.

09:53.510 --> 09:54.690
How did you

09:54.870 --> 09:55.960
get my proposal?

09:56.200 --> 09:58.460
I didn't even keep a record
or save a copy.

09:58.550 --> 09:59.950
Where did you get it from?

10:01.670 --> 10:03.240
Here. Take a look.

10:06.440 --> 10:07.930
Since you've experienced

10:07.960 --> 10:09.360
the pain of losing files,

10:09.720 --> 10:10.910
I must ask you to always be prepared

10:10.910 --> 10:14.040
to back up your records
anytime, anywhere in the future.

10:14.270 --> 10:15.910
I don't care if you
hand-copy, take pictures,

10:15.910 --> 10:17.770
or convert to PDF and then to Word.

10:18.480 --> 10:19.410
Whenever you...

10:19.480 --> 10:20.630
I'm talking to you.

10:20.790 --> 10:22.670
Why are you snooping on my privacy?

10:22.670 --> 10:25.200
Who's invading
someone else's privacy here?

10:26.000 --> 10:27.440
So disgusting. I'll delete this for you.

10:27.440 --> 10:28.700
Why delete it?

10:30.120 --> 10:31.560
I won't delete it.

10:32.160 --> 10:32.970
So what?

10:33.250 --> 10:34.110
Suit yourself.

10:34.240 --> 10:34.930
Suit myself?

10:34.930 --> 10:36.110
Okay, Landlady.

10:36.130 --> 10:37.560
Then I'll send it out tomorrow.

10:37.560 --> 10:39.220
The whole company will see it.

10:39.440 --> 10:40.630
Dude, this is a workplace.

10:40.630 --> 10:42.360
Please don't call me Landlady.

10:42.360 --> 10:43.030
Also,

10:43.510 --> 10:45.000
I hope you can find a new place soon

10:45.000 --> 10:46.840
and move out of my house
as soon as possible.

10:46.840 --> 10:48.020
Thank you for today.

10:48.160 --> 10:50.160
I'll go now if there's nothing else.

10:52.200 --> 10:52.600
You...

11:00.390 --> 11:01.520
What's got into you?

11:15.000 --> 11:15.630
Qian Fei.

11:17.240 --> 11:18.270
Director Fang has assigned you

11:18.270 --> 11:20.670
the task of organizing the working papers.

11:22.000 --> 11:23.910
I don't know what she means.

11:23.910 --> 11:25.840
Given your strong work ability,

11:25.840 --> 11:27.700
she shouldn't make you do chores.

11:28.000 --> 11:28.600
It's fine.

11:29.870 --> 11:31.330
I'll get back to work then.

11:44.240 --> 11:44.690
Director Fang

11:44.690 --> 11:46.690
is deliberately wasting your time.

11:47.870 --> 11:49.510
This is our company's internal matter,

11:49.510 --> 11:50.840
so don't worry about it.

11:52.720 --> 11:54.160
Can you speak normally?

11:54.440 --> 11:55.500
How am I not normal?

11:55.550 --> 11:56.350
Wait a minute.

11:57.270 --> 11:58.670
Go to the rooftop garden.

11:58.720 --> 12:00.030
I have something to tell you.

12:00.030 --> 12:01.380
Why can't you say it here?

12:01.380 --> 12:02.110
I just can't.

12:02.550 --> 12:03.410
Come right now.

12:25.440 --> 12:26.120
Tell me.

12:26.510 --> 12:28.510
From yesterday afternoon to today,

12:29.510 --> 12:31.060
your attitude towards me

12:31.550 --> 12:33.600
has done a complete 180.

12:34.670 --> 12:35.430
Why?

12:37.240 --> 12:37.870
Nothing.

12:38.000 --> 12:38.750
Nothing?

12:39.270 --> 12:41.360
Qian Fei, you are an outspoken person.

12:41.360 --> 12:42.890
You always speak your mind.

12:43.440 --> 12:45.000
The workplace is like a battlefield.

12:45.000 --> 12:46.000
Being outspoken

12:46.000 --> 12:48.330
often means
being used as a pawn by others.

12:50.150 --> 12:51.160
What do you mean?

12:52.840 --> 12:54.170
You think I'm using you?

12:56.600 --> 12:58.660
Then I'll be outspoken one more time.

12:59.120 --> 13:01.960
When you helped me
revise the research report before,

13:01.960 --> 13:03.180
your real purpose

13:03.550 --> 13:05.840
was to expose Shan Li Fang's data problems

13:05.840 --> 13:07.240
in front of Director Fang

13:07.910 --> 13:09.870
so she wouldn't play dumb anymore, right?

13:09.870 --> 13:12.120
I was just your pawn back then, wasn't I?

13:20.860 --> 13:21.660
Not entirely.

13:24.200 --> 13:25.550
I used to think

13:25.630 --> 13:27.670
you were different
from those who have been

13:27.670 --> 13:29.000
in this industry for years,

13:29.000 --> 13:31.630
who, besides having high IQs and talent,

13:31.910 --> 13:34.050
are also full of schemes.

13:35.150 --> 13:36.150
At least I thought

13:36.150 --> 13:38.350
you were innocent and optimistic.

13:38.840 --> 13:41.100
But now I realize I was completely wrong.

13:41.440 --> 13:42.940
You are just like them.

13:47.600 --> 13:49.060
Innocent and optimistic?

13:49.720 --> 13:51.550
Do you think
I don't want to be innocent and optimistic

13:51.550 --> 13:53.150
when facing those problems?

13:53.440 --> 13:55.500
How can I be innocent and optimistic?

13:55.750 --> 13:57.390
This is not a fairy tale.

13:58.200 --> 13:59.120
Not all goodness

13:59.120 --> 14:00.720
can ultimately defeat evil.

14:03.670 --> 14:05.190
Back in the company,

14:05.870 --> 14:08.240
you helped other project teams
organize working papers a lot, didn't you?

14:08.240 --> 14:09.720
Did you think you were doing a great job

14:09.720 --> 14:11.520
and felt pleased with yourself?

14:11.800 --> 14:12.660
Let me tell you.

14:13.240 --> 14:15.470
You were simply being used for free.

14:17.000 --> 14:19.460
No one is going to share their bonus
with you.

14:19.630 --> 14:20.790
Of course I know it.

14:20.910 --> 14:22.240
Do you think I'm stupid?

14:24.550 --> 14:26.950
So you think
just staying in the back office

14:27.320 --> 14:28.750
and only dealing with data

14:28.750 --> 14:30.240
can help you stay

14:30.260 --> 14:31.890
innocent and optimistic?

14:33.240 --> 14:35.570
At least that's what I thought
at the time.

14:36.160 --> 14:38.150
Because I didn't want to deal with people.

14:38.150 --> 14:40.310
But now you've moved to the front office.

14:40.310 --> 14:42.050
You have to deal with people.

14:45.240 --> 14:47.900
But I still have to organize
the working papers.

14:48.220 --> 14:50.490
Then go talk to Director Fang.

14:50.690 --> 14:51.390
Tell her

14:51.390 --> 14:52.600
you want to participate
in writing the prospectus.

14:52.600 --> 14:53.960
Let her know your capabilities.

14:53.960 --> 14:55.150
You don't need to feel embarrassed
about it.

14:55.150 --> 14:56.720
Don't be afraid of what others think.

14:56.720 --> 14:58.600
If a capable person
doesn't show their ability,

14:58.600 --> 14:59.120
in the end,

14:59.120 --> 14:59.840
in others' eyes,

14:59.840 --> 15:01.600
you're just an incapable person.

15:01.600 --> 15:02.330
Understand?

15:14.870 --> 15:16.510
Stick to the bottom line.

15:17.830 --> 15:19.960
Stay true to your original intention.

15:20.550 --> 15:23.720
Even if we wade through
countless dangerous shoals,

15:23.840 --> 15:24.670
we will

15:26.630 --> 15:29.030
keep working hard, move forward steadily,

15:29.480 --> 15:31.610
and never deviate from our direction.

15:33.030 --> 15:34.430
You are making a poem now.

15:36.240 --> 15:36.770
How is it?

15:36.790 --> 15:39.190
Do you still acknowledge me
as your master?

15:39.600 --> 15:41.080
Since someone is so eager

15:41.080 --> 15:42.790
to be my master for free,

15:43.320 --> 15:46.300
I will reluctantly accept you.

15:46.550 --> 15:48.010
Who told you it's for free?

15:50.010 --> 15:52.510
When other companies
invite me to give lectures,

15:52.510 --> 15:54.570
the hourly rate starts from 5 digits.

15:54.730 --> 15:56.330
I'll give you a 20% discount.

15:56.750 --> 15:58.190
We can either deduct it from the rent,

15:58.190 --> 16:00.460
or from the food expenses.

16:01.320 --> 16:02.080
If we deduct it from the food expenses,

16:02.080 --> 16:04.860
does that mean
I won't have to pay for food anymore?

16:04.860 --> 16:05.980
In your dreams.

16:07.790 --> 16:09.270
Aren't you quite docile?

16:09.290 --> 16:11.420
Come on, recite this poem after me.

16:11.440 --> 16:12.320
No.

16:12.630 --> 16:13.270
No!

16:13.340 --> 16:14.140
Let's do it.

16:14.670 --> 16:15.550
-No.
-It's good for your development.

16:15.550 --> 16:17.000
Come on, repeat after me.

16:18.480 --> 16:20.240
Stick to the bottom line.

16:21.030 --> 16:22.960
Stick to the bottom line.

16:23.600 --> 16:25.660
Stay true to our original intention.

16:56.820 --> 16:58.020
Stop hiding.

16:58.920 --> 17:00.240
I'm not hiding from you.

17:00.240 --> 17:01.640
Why would I hide from you?

17:02.350 --> 17:03.790
Are you that afraid of me?

17:03.960 --> 17:04.829
When you hand over a document,

17:04.829 --> 17:05.829
you won't even show your face.

17:05.829 --> 17:07.160
You've been dodging me like this.

17:07.160 --> 17:07.720
I'll be working here

17:07.720 --> 17:09.349
for quite a long time.

17:09.829 --> 17:12.890
What you're doing
will greatly increase the workload.

17:14.329 --> 17:15.930
There are too many eyes here.

17:16.109 --> 17:17.359
Why don't we find

17:17.480 --> 17:18.640
a quiet place to talk?

17:18.640 --> 17:19.920
Are you afraid of being seen?

17:19.920 --> 17:20.650
Don't worry.

17:20.829 --> 17:22.240
The gossip has already spread.

17:22.240 --> 17:24.030
People won't talk less

17:24.030 --> 17:25.490
just because you avoid me.

17:25.810 --> 17:27.970
Can you just relax?

17:29.030 --> 17:30.160
The less you care,

17:30.160 --> 17:31.850
the sooner people will forget about it.

17:31.850 --> 17:32.650
Wang Ruohai.

17:33.720 --> 17:35.610
I've already moved on.

17:35.640 --> 17:37.040
What are you so afraid of?

17:38.000 --> 17:39.580
Can you act properly

17:39.680 --> 17:42.120
and separate work from personal life?

17:42.590 --> 17:44.000
Act like a man, alright?

17:47.830 --> 17:48.760
You've changed.

17:49.980 --> 17:51.380
You seem quite different

17:51.550 --> 17:52.640
from before.

17:53.200 --> 17:56.530
[Shan Li Fang Hotel Group]

17:53.680 --> 17:54.270
Yes.

17:54.820 --> 17:56.820
Because my goals are different now.

17:57.550 --> 17:59.440
I've been stationed
at Shan Li Fang Hotel Group

17:59.440 --> 18:00.520
for a while now.

18:01.110 --> 18:02.440
You should be used to it.

18:03.030 --> 18:05.360
So be more professional from now on, okay?

18:07.160 --> 18:08.620
I'm going to the restroom.

18:23.960 --> 18:24.560
What is it?

18:27.400 --> 18:28.070
Why?

18:29.420 --> 18:30.680
Why did they do this?

18:32.720 --> 18:34.440
Shan Li Fang has invested
so much in Xinxin Vision

18:34.440 --> 18:35.440
and had such high expectations of it.

18:35.440 --> 18:37.770
How could they just give up on us
like that?

18:38.790 --> 18:40.680
Impossible. Absolutely impossible.

18:40.680 --> 18:41.680
Liao Jinshan told me

18:41.680 --> 18:43.540
he would take us public together.

18:45.270 --> 18:45.640
I kn—

18:45.640 --> 18:46.440
Don't panic, okay?

18:46.440 --> 18:47.310
Don't worry.

18:47.450 --> 18:48.980
I'll handle this, alright?

18:52.680 --> 18:53.400
Alright, I have to go.

18:53.400 --> 18:54.510
I'm hanging up.

18:57.240 --> 18:58.160
What's wrong?

18:58.180 --> 18:59.610
You don't look so good.

18:59.720 --> 19:00.270
Do I?

19:00.990 --> 19:02.990
Maybe I've been hungry for too long.

19:03.680 --> 19:04.550
So it's my fault?

19:04.550 --> 19:05.200
No.

19:05.200 --> 19:07.530
Let's go.
I'll take you out for a good meal.

19:29.550 --> 19:30.410
Director Fang.

19:37.790 --> 19:39.040
I want to talk to you

19:39.720 --> 19:41.180
about my job description.

19:43.640 --> 19:44.290
Sure.

19:45.310 --> 19:47.440
I've been waiting for you to come to me.

19:49.750 --> 19:50.280
Let's go.

19:56.100 --> 19:57.570
That's about it.

19:59.720 --> 20:00.450
Are you done?

20:01.640 --> 20:03.900
I've laid out everything I have to offer.

20:04.000 --> 20:05.240
You know Shan Li Fang Hotel Group

20:05.240 --> 20:06.400
inside out.

20:08.590 --> 20:09.790
I knew you'd do this.

20:10.310 --> 20:12.000
Otherwise, I wouldn't have kept
someone from the back office

20:12.000 --> 20:12.830
by my side.

20:13.530 --> 20:14.530
But you know what?

20:15.350 --> 20:16.590
To win someone over,

20:16.590 --> 20:17.830
it takes more than just ability.

20:17.830 --> 20:19.560
It also depends on confidence.

20:20.510 --> 20:21.720
You know, for the longest time,

20:21.720 --> 20:22.880
I've been waiting for you
to have the courage

20:22.880 --> 20:24.340
to show me your abilities.

20:27.070 --> 20:28.470
I'm glad the wait is over.

20:30.310 --> 20:30.840
Alright.

20:31.440 --> 20:33.040
Come work with me from now on.

20:34.110 --> 20:34.720
Really?

20:37.030 --> 20:39.350
You can start with the prospectus.

20:39.350 --> 20:41.110
Write about the issuer's personal profile

20:41.110 --> 20:42.110
and their historical evolution.

20:42.110 --> 20:44.110
This will play to your strengths
in writing

20:44.110 --> 20:45.650
and concise phrasing.

20:46.000 --> 20:47.050
Besides,

20:47.270 --> 20:49.610
knowing every detail of the working papers

20:49.610 --> 20:52.540
will give you a deeper understanding
of the company.

20:54.200 --> 20:56.240
Finance isn't a problem for you, right?

20:56.240 --> 20:57.410
Do you have a CPA?

20:58.070 --> 20:58.780
Great.

20:59.550 --> 21:00.510
Then at tomorrow's meeting,

21:00.510 --> 21:01.680
you can join us

21:01.790 --> 21:03.470
to discuss financial issues.

21:06.930 --> 21:08.590
Is that the only word you know?

21:10.550 --> 21:11.440
I'm just so happy.

21:11.440 --> 21:12.640
It feels like a dream.

21:18.550 --> 21:20.610
I guess torturing you wasn't in vain.

21:22.350 --> 21:23.460
Stop it!

21:24.590 --> 21:26.050
Thank you, Director Fang.

21:27.410 --> 21:28.520
Don't celebrate too soon.

21:28.520 --> 21:29.440
Keep up the good work.

21:29.440 --> 21:29.810
Okay!

21:31.210 --> 21:38.510
[Shanghai World Financial Center]

21:54.160 --> 21:54.790
Dang Yu.

21:59.480 --> 22:00.680
What exactly do you want?

22:00.680 --> 22:01.750
I came to pick you up from work

22:01.750 --> 22:03.080
and treat you to dinner.

22:03.270 --> 22:04.130
This is for you.

22:05.440 --> 22:07.640
Look, you're a decent guy.

22:07.640 --> 22:09.240
Why can't you understand me?

22:09.550 --> 22:10.790
You keep sending me gifts

22:10.790 --> 22:11.850
and flowers.

22:12.440 --> 22:15.270
I already told you there should be limits
when it comes to pursuing a girl.

22:15.270 --> 22:15.830
It's fine.

22:15.830 --> 22:17.490
I just want to give them to you.

22:19.510 --> 22:21.550
I know you don't have
to work your part-time job tonight.

22:21.550 --> 22:25.210
-Let's have dinner together, alright?
-Dang Yu, your boyfriend?

22:25.790 --> 22:26.590
Not yet.

22:26.830 --> 22:27.830
He's pretty cute.

22:28.000 --> 22:29.630
-No.
-Not yet?

22:31.110 --> 22:31.440
Pretty cute.

22:31.440 --> 22:32.000
Pretty cute.

22:32.000 --> 22:32.880
She denied it.

22:32.880 --> 22:33.700
Go for it.

22:33.920 --> 22:34.440
He is quite cute.

22:34.440 --> 22:35.310
Yeah.

22:35.400 --> 22:37.130
You want to have dinner, right?

22:38.270 --> 22:39.480
My car is over there.

22:41.720 --> 22:42.270
Let's go.

22:42.400 --> 22:43.930
Don't you want the flowers?

22:55.160 --> 22:56.140
I'm full.

22:56.510 --> 22:58.370
I guess this meal is finished now.

22:58.590 --> 22:59.320
I'm leaving.

22:59.480 --> 23:00.540
Since you're full,

23:01.550 --> 23:03.550
can you listen to me for a bit?

23:05.680 --> 23:06.740
Make it quick then.

23:08.270 --> 23:09.780
I want to

23:10.030 --> 23:11.160
officially date you

23:11.480 --> 23:12.460
from today.

23:14.920 --> 23:15.480
What?

23:16.830 --> 23:17.440
I know

23:17.440 --> 23:19.460
the impression I left you before

23:19.510 --> 23:20.220
wasn't very good.

23:20.220 --> 23:22.080
So treating you to this meal today

23:22.160 --> 23:24.450
is also to let you get to know me.

23:24.590 --> 23:27.510
I hope you can give me a chance.

23:28.400 --> 23:29.160
Impossible.

23:29.920 --> 23:31.510
Let me finish first.

23:36.160 --> 23:37.330
My name is Jun Cheng.

23:37.550 --> 23:39.210
My friends all call me Jun.

23:39.440 --> 23:40.600
I am 26 years old,

23:40.680 --> 23:41.680
a Shanghai local.

23:42.000 --> 23:43.110
I'm currently working

23:43.110 --> 23:44.770
at a sub-district office.

23:45.030 --> 23:47.880
My mom thinks this job is close to home

23:48.030 --> 23:48.990
and stable.

23:49.110 --> 23:51.640
Right now, I'm just
a grassroots civil servant.

23:51.640 --> 23:52.720
But I believe

23:52.720 --> 23:53.660
that as long as I work hard,

23:53.660 --> 23:56.000
I will definitely get a promotion
within 5 years.

23:56.000 --> 23:57.030
In my spare time,

23:57.030 --> 23:58.550
I play video games and stuff.

23:58.550 --> 23:59.920
But what I like doing the most

23:59.920 --> 24:01.450
is watching you play games.

24:04.260 --> 24:05.180
Right now,

24:05.210 --> 24:06.810
I live with my parents.

24:06.960 --> 24:08.350
So, I have no rent pressure,

24:08.350 --> 24:09.720
nor any mortgage burden.

24:09.720 --> 24:11.120
What I earn is what I keep.

24:12.350 --> 24:14.120
As for my love life...

24:14.720 --> 24:15.750
To be honest...

24:16.640 --> 24:18.570
I've never been in a relationship.

24:18.720 --> 24:20.760
I liked a girl when I was in school.

24:21.160 --> 24:23.480
But my mom told me to study hard

24:23.480 --> 24:25.400
and not to mess around with such things.

24:25.400 --> 24:26.460
So I don't have much

24:26.590 --> 24:28.390
experience dealing with girls.

24:28.550 --> 24:29.520
And also...

24:29.550 --> 24:30.730
Wait a minute.

24:30.790 --> 24:31.880
Well...

24:32.160 --> 24:33.460
You said so much.

24:34.160 --> 24:35.480
Besides loving to watch me play games,

24:35.480 --> 24:37.590
does any of it have anything to do
with me?

24:37.590 --> 24:38.730
It does.

24:39.110 --> 24:40.440
I think as long as you can

24:40.550 --> 24:41.480
get to know me more

24:41.480 --> 24:42.640
and understand me more,

24:42.640 --> 24:44.980
your evaluation of me will be higher.

24:45.310 --> 24:47.970
Then the chance
of you liking me will be greater.

24:49.960 --> 24:51.220
You like me, don't you?

24:53.030 --> 24:54.160
But I don't like you.

24:55.240 --> 24:57.000
You just don't like me now.

24:57.000 --> 24:58.930
Maybe you'll like me in the future.

25:06.350 --> 25:06.950
Is that so?

25:08.160 --> 25:09.830
I've more or less learned

25:09.830 --> 25:11.290
the basic facts about you.

25:12.550 --> 25:13.460
To me,

25:14.470 --> 25:16.440
your personality is a dealbreaker,

25:16.440 --> 25:17.900
your job is a dealbreaker,

25:17.920 --> 25:20.450
and your family
is even more of a dealbreaker.

25:21.000 --> 25:22.640
We don't have a chance.

25:24.160 --> 25:25.440
This meal today

25:25.440 --> 25:27.420
is your official confession to me,

25:27.590 --> 25:29.800
and my official rejection of you.

25:30.270 --> 25:30.920
So from now on,

25:30.920 --> 25:32.720
please don't bother me anymore.

25:33.240 --> 25:34.640
Also, as a grown man,

25:34.640 --> 25:36.970
don't order so much
if you can't finish it.

25:38.350 --> 25:39.940
This meal is on me.

25:40.030 --> 25:41.490
You can pack up the rest

25:41.520 --> 25:42.850
and eat it with your mom.

25:44.440 --> 25:45.800
Excuse me.

25:47.000 --> 25:48.000
Pack this for him.

25:48.350 --> 25:49.160
Coming.

25:55.830 --> 25:57.630
Sir, what would you like to pack?

26:04.160 --> 26:05.510
Stop drinking.

26:05.540 --> 26:07.800
You'll have an allergic reaction again.

26:08.270 --> 26:09.540
Why?

26:10.270 --> 26:11.930
Can anyone explain this to me?

26:11.960 --> 26:13.660
Why doesn't she like me?

26:15.830 --> 26:18.020
Bro, please help him out.

26:18.960 --> 26:21.300
Isn't that girl your landlady's friend?

26:22.270 --> 26:23.240
Let me tell you.

26:23.240 --> 26:24.210
Li Yifei

26:24.590 --> 26:25.960
can't be counted on anymore.

26:25.960 --> 26:26.750
He's not the Li Yifei

26:26.750 --> 26:28.210
that you guys used to know.

26:28.230 --> 26:30.570
He can't even handle his own affairs now.

26:31.000 --> 26:32.310
You can't even handle your own affairs,

26:32.310 --> 26:33.240
and you're meddling
in someone else's business?

26:33.240 --> 26:34.150
Leave his matter

26:34.150 --> 26:35.240
all to me, okay?

26:35.240 --> 26:36.340
I'll arrange a girl for you.

26:36.340 --> 26:37.540
Don't talk nonsense.

26:37.880 --> 26:40.410
Why don't you two
just make do with each other?

26:40.720 --> 26:41.440
I...

26:42.750 --> 26:43.710
I'm leaving.

26:43.880 --> 26:45.000
Where are you going?

26:45.000 --> 26:46.120
You're so drunk.

26:46.240 --> 26:47.680
I'm going to play the game.

26:47.680 --> 26:49.170
At least in the game,

26:49.720 --> 26:51.130
I can overcome obstacles

26:51.270 --> 26:52.270
and achieve great things.

26:52.270 --> 26:53.500
Most importantly,

26:53.790 --> 26:55.450
if anyone makes me mad,

26:56.030 --> 26:57.030
I can beat them up.

26:58.510 --> 26:59.200
I'm off!

26:59.550 --> 27:00.880
Are you really leaving?

27:02.110 --> 27:03.200
Take care.

27:03.640 --> 27:04.490
Go for it.

27:06.400 --> 27:08.110
When will this kid grow up?

27:09.110 --> 27:09.700
Cheers.

27:10.330 --> 27:12.930
He shouldn't get too addicted
to the internet.

27:16.880 --> 27:18.200
I'm back.

27:18.570 --> 27:19.680
Welcome home.

27:23.640 --> 27:25.350
What are you cooking
in the middle of the night?

27:25.350 --> 27:26.250
Porridge.

27:26.530 --> 27:27.380
Porridge?

27:27.880 --> 27:29.880
I thought you didn't like porridge.

27:30.830 --> 27:32.310
You're being so nice to me now.

27:32.310 --> 27:34.370
You're even cooking porridge for me.

27:35.510 --> 27:36.940
I'm cooking this for Zhao De.

27:36.940 --> 27:38.600
Doesn't he have a bad stomach?

27:39.070 --> 27:40.720
I just happened to be making porridge,

27:40.720 --> 27:42.120
so I made some for him too.

27:42.880 --> 27:44.110
What are you talking about?

27:44.110 --> 27:45.710
You call that "happened to"?

27:46.070 --> 27:48.700
You're cooking it specially for him.

27:49.960 --> 27:51.200
Let me remind you,

27:51.440 --> 27:53.440
Zhao De's career is on the rise right now.

27:53.440 --> 27:54.910
Don't get any ideas about him.

27:54.910 --> 27:56.810
What are you saying? Disgusting.

27:56.920 --> 27:58.050
Do you think everyone is like you,

27:58.050 --> 27:59.160
so goal-oriented?

27:59.830 --> 28:01.830
I'm doing this for everyone's good.

28:02.400 --> 28:03.440
Besides,

28:03.480 --> 28:05.220
I've taught you a lot, right?

28:06.000 --> 28:07.890
I'm your master, after all.

28:08.240 --> 28:10.370
I thought you made it specially for me.

28:10.440 --> 28:11.920
You're being biased.

28:30.440 --> 28:32.480
Good to see you have some conscience.

28:32.480 --> 28:34.920
You're not completely hopeless.

28:36.310 --> 28:39.310
Come on, tell me. Why did you
make porridge for me tonight?

28:39.310 --> 28:42.240
I made too much, so I gave it to you
to avoid wasting it.

28:43.070 --> 28:43.800
See?

28:44.030 --> 28:46.130
I already knew you would say that.

28:48.270 --> 28:50.960
I understand. Not wanting to waste food
is the main reason.

28:50.960 --> 28:52.310
So what's the second reason?

28:52.310 --> 28:55.370
Director Fang allowed me
to help write the prospectus.

28:56.200 --> 28:56.950
Really?

28:58.270 --> 28:59.200
That's great!

28:59.690 --> 29:00.850
See? I told you.

29:00.880 --> 29:03.260
My landlady is on a winning streak.

29:03.480 --> 29:04.070
Right?

29:05.720 --> 29:06.640
Of course,

29:07.130 --> 29:07.890
it's mainly

29:09.200 --> 29:11.310
because I taught you well.

29:12.510 --> 29:13.310
Tell you what.

29:13.990 --> 29:15.190
I'll give you a chance

29:15.590 --> 29:16.920
to thank me properly.

29:17.680 --> 29:19.720
I'll give you the chance to be the chef

29:19.720 --> 29:20.880
for the next week.

29:21.480 --> 29:23.100
So you can properly thank me.

29:24.200 --> 29:26.980
You're taking credit
and taking advantage of me.

29:27.400 --> 29:28.780
How can you be like this?

29:29.490 --> 29:31.030
I don't have money for groceries.

29:31.030 --> 29:33.230
I can't afford to feed a big dog like you.

29:35.000 --> 29:35.980
No money?

29:37.350 --> 29:39.350
You're telling me you have no money?

29:41.140 --> 29:42.310
How ridiculous!

29:49.510 --> 29:52.440
From now on, my food expenses

29:52.680 --> 29:54.260
will come out of here.

29:54.440 --> 29:56.640
Don't tell me you have no money anymore.

29:57.310 --> 29:58.410
This little amount of money

29:58.410 --> 29:59.600
isn't even enough for one meal.

29:59.600 --> 30:01.590
Do you know
how expensive things are nowadays?

30:01.590 --> 30:02.720
Then how about this?

30:03.720 --> 30:06.210
When the money in here runs out,

30:06.720 --> 30:07.850
you won't

30:08.350 --> 30:10.030
have to cook for me anymore.

30:10.400 --> 30:11.940
Okay, it's a deal.

30:13.090 --> 30:15.420
So you don't keep making me
your free chef.

30:15.680 --> 30:18.730
And... your food expenses

30:18.950 --> 30:20.480
can also be taken from here.

30:21.000 --> 30:22.970
Consider it your chef's fee.

30:25.030 --> 30:27.640
How could a master
take advantage of his disciple?

30:27.640 --> 30:28.520
Right?

30:30.350 --> 30:31.300
Thank you.

30:31.480 --> 30:32.230
Come on.

30:32.510 --> 30:34.310
Let me taste this bowl of

30:35.680 --> 30:37.610
"night porridge with love" first.

30:39.800 --> 30:41.700
The consistency is just right.

31:23.510 --> 31:25.510
I didn't expect it to actually work.

31:26.480 --> 31:28.230
[More Pictures]

31:28.380 --> 31:29.540
[All Photos]

31:29.950 --> 31:31.080
She's quite pretty.

31:33.730 --> 31:34.480
Is it her?

31:36.920 --> 31:38.510
It's all pictures of this girl.

31:38.510 --> 31:40.030
-It must be her.
-Yes.

31:41.920 --> 31:43.560
The problem is these photos

31:43.590 --> 31:45.850
seem to be downloaded from the internet.

31:46.050 --> 31:46.800
Right.

31:47.110 --> 31:47.510
Look.

31:48.440 --> 31:50.070
Singing here, dancing there.

31:50.070 --> 31:51.660
And being a bartender?

31:53.200 --> 31:54.650
Could she be an actress?

31:56.070 --> 31:58.400
That would be bad.

31:58.400 --> 31:59.490
Then Jun...

31:59.920 --> 32:01.160
Wouldn't it be harder for Jun then?

32:01.160 --> 32:02.890
Right, Jun is going to suffer.

32:03.110 --> 32:03.880
Mom.

32:05.880 --> 32:07.280
I can't eat anymore.

32:21.080 --> 32:24.680
[Shan Li Fang Hotel Group]
[CEO Office]

32:22.030 --> 32:23.760
Qian Fei, hurry and clean it up.

32:24.240 --> 32:25.730
Why should I clean it up?

32:26.200 --> 32:27.220
Why?

32:27.310 --> 32:29.200
Did you forget
you are my special assistant?

32:29.200 --> 32:30.650
This is your job.

32:32.510 --> 32:33.580
Boss, let me.

32:33.680 --> 32:34.680
Let you?

32:38.720 --> 32:40.270
Let me say a few words.

32:40.550 --> 32:42.270
Director Fang did tell our boss

32:42.270 --> 32:43.880
to let you get more training.

32:44.030 --> 32:44.640
See?

32:44.920 --> 32:46.540
So this is your job.

32:46.880 --> 32:48.680
We still have over an hour now.

32:48.680 --> 32:49.590
Hurry and clean it up,

32:49.590 --> 32:51.450
so we can play a few rounds of poker

32:51.510 --> 32:52.530
with Boss.

32:53.550 --> 32:54.410
Listen to this.

32:54.550 --> 32:55.070
Let me.

33:00.480 --> 33:01.940
That's called awareness.

33:02.160 --> 33:03.830
Playing poker isn't work, is it?

33:03.830 --> 33:05.240
I need to take a nap in a bit.

33:05.240 --> 33:06.450
How is it not work?

33:07.310 --> 33:10.070
Helping your supervisor strike a balance
between work and rest

33:10.070 --> 33:11.470
to maintain efficiency,

33:11.510 --> 33:13.760
that is your job as a special assistant.

33:14.920 --> 33:16.070
If you don't play with us,

33:16.070 --> 33:17.530
we'll be one person short.

33:17.550 --> 33:20.070
That means the activity can't proceed.

33:20.070 --> 33:21.930
Once the activity can't proceed,

33:22.110 --> 33:24.880
it will directly affect
my work efficiency this afternoon.

33:24.880 --> 33:26.210
As a special assistant,

33:28.110 --> 33:29.370
can you take on...

33:31.250 --> 33:32.600
this responsibility?

33:35.160 --> 33:36.920
She can't. She can't.

33:40.620 --> 33:43.080
I'm so unlucky to have a boss like you.

33:54.350 --> 33:57.910
[Office]

33:57.400 --> 33:58.280
Qian Fei.

33:58.920 --> 33:59.440
Director Fang.

33:59.440 --> 34:00.480
The biggest supplier

34:00.480 --> 34:01.550
of Shan Li Fang Hotel Group has arrived.

34:01.550 --> 34:02.550
We were supposed to have a meeting,

34:02.550 --> 34:04.150
but I've got something urgent today.

34:04.150 --> 34:05.850
You'll work with Mr. Li

34:06.400 --> 34:07.320
to handle the due diligence

34:07.320 --> 34:08.150
and make proper preparations.

34:08.150 --> 34:08.679
Okay.

34:14.639 --> 34:15.639
[Information of Lyvrong Group]

34:16.070 --> 34:18.429
Mr. Niu Xindong,
Chairman of Lyvrong Group]

34:22.570 --> 34:23.960
[Ms. Gui Lili, Assistant to the Chairman
of Lyvrong Group

34:25.860 --> 34:28.130
It seems Li Yifei doesn't know it yet.

34:28.150 --> 34:29.190
If he sees Gui Lili,

34:29.190 --> 34:30.360
how will he react?

34:31.340 --> 34:33.280
Oh my god. I can't even imagine.

34:33.310 --> 34:34.989
Should I give him a heads up?

34:35.550 --> 34:36.139
Right.

34:36.500 --> 34:38.159
I'd better prepare him for it.

34:46.070 --> 34:47.400
I need to tell you something.

34:47.400 --> 34:48.440
-Later...
-Wait a minute.

34:48.440 --> 34:49.400
They'll be here soon.

34:49.400 --> 34:50.400
Let's talk later.

34:50.550 --> 34:51.000
Sit.

34:55.510 --> 34:56.030
Come.

34:56.060 --> 34:56.590
Come.

34:56.760 --> 34:57.090
Okay.

34:57.110 --> 34:58.440
We haven't seen each other
for a long time.

34:58.440 --> 34:59.280
Come on.

35:07.590 --> 35:08.630
Hello, everyone.

35:08.760 --> 35:10.170
This is our company's

35:10.200 --> 35:11.550
assistant to the chairman.

35:11.550 --> 35:13.000
Hello, everyone. My name is Gui Lili.

35:13.000 --> 35:13.880
Chairman Niu couldn't make it today

35:13.880 --> 35:15.690
because of some emergencies,

35:15.800 --> 35:18.080
so he asked me to meet you on his behalf.

35:18.400 --> 35:19.470
That's fine.

35:19.840 --> 35:21.670
I'm Li Yifei from Zhizhong Investment.

35:21.670 --> 35:22.360
Welcome.

35:25.160 --> 35:25.720
Hello.

35:27.150 --> 35:28.210
Please take a seat.

35:30.980 --> 35:32.960
Let me introduce the supply process.

35:32.960 --> 35:33.860
Sales,

35:34.160 --> 35:35.490
Marketing Operations Department,

35:35.490 --> 35:37.350
Procurement, QC, and Finance...

35:38.100 --> 35:40.070
[Sales] [Marketing Operations Department]
[Procurement] [QC] [Finance]

36:02.740 --> 36:04.420
I don't know why,

36:04.510 --> 36:06.360
but I feel like Li Yifei today

36:06.360 --> 36:08.090
is different from usual.

36:08.710 --> 36:10.930
Every move and gesture

36:11.290 --> 36:13.130
seems carefully calculated,

36:14.000 --> 36:15.600
always landing in

36:15.620 --> 36:17.750
the most pleasing way.

36:19.750 --> 36:22.600
I really underestimated Li Yifei's EQ.

36:22.800 --> 36:26.340
I just thought he was demanding,
willful, and bad-tempered.

36:26.720 --> 36:29.250
But he is actually more scheming
than anyone.

36:29.740 --> 36:31.630
No wonder he's so elegant today.

36:32.270 --> 36:33.800
He knows this is the best way

36:33.810 --> 36:37.020
to make his ex sad, unable to forget him,
and regretful.

36:53.280 --> 36:55.070
That's roughly it for today's meeting.

36:55.070 --> 36:56.930
Does anyone have anything to add?

36:57.630 --> 36:59.490
If not, the meeting is adjourned.

37:04.230 --> 37:04.840
Oh, right.

37:05.800 --> 37:06.660
Assistant Gui.

37:07.030 --> 37:08.110
Shan Li Fang Hotel Group

37:08.110 --> 37:09.440
has provided lunch for everyone.

37:09.440 --> 37:11.100
Do you want to stay and join us?

37:12.960 --> 37:13.620
I'm sorry.

37:13.650 --> 37:15.760
I'm not feeling well today,

37:15.840 --> 37:17.940
so I won't join you for lunch.

37:20.320 --> 37:21.510
Please keep everyone company for me.

37:21.510 --> 37:22.110
Okay.

37:35.960 --> 37:38.510
It's a pity you can't stay this time.

37:41.510 --> 37:42.110
It's here.

37:44.630 --> 37:45.800
I'll get going then.

37:45.820 --> 37:46.320
Okay.

37:46.550 --> 37:47.810
Take care of everyone.

37:48.510 --> 37:49.040
Bye-bye.

37:49.110 --> 37:49.710
Bye-bye.

37:53.760 --> 37:54.740
Old classmate,

37:55.230 --> 37:58.030
what's the background
on this chairman's assistant?

37:58.030 --> 37:59.070
She's so young.

37:59.150 --> 38:01.080
I saw you were sucking up to her too.

38:01.440 --> 38:03.040
She's our chairman's woman.

38:03.320 --> 38:04.660
Our chairman—

38:04.920 --> 38:06.590
I don't know if he planned it all along,

38:06.590 --> 38:08.500
or if he divorced because of her.

38:09.360 --> 38:10.890
Actually, right now,

38:10.910 --> 38:12.860
she is our chairman's fiancée.

38:13.630 --> 38:15.400
I guess it won't be long

38:15.400 --> 38:16.930
before they get married.

38:17.230 --> 38:19.090
Did you hear everything just now?

38:22.930 --> 38:24.450
You were so cool just now.

38:24.480 --> 38:25.550
It was like you were using cheat codes.

38:25.550 --> 38:26.480
Good for you.

38:26.710 --> 38:28.400
Look at how easily impressed you are.

38:28.400 --> 38:29.660
You think that's cool?

38:29.800 --> 38:31.670
If your master here
ever really turns on the cheat codes,

38:31.670 --> 38:34.330
you'll be crying and begging me
not to be so cool,

38:34.360 --> 38:36.090
or you won't be able to survive.

38:36.440 --> 38:38.840
Good thing I haven't eaten,
or I'd throw up.

38:40.840 --> 38:41.590
Swallow it.

38:44.590 --> 38:45.120
Guan Xin,

38:45.320 --> 38:46.480
what should we eat for lunch?

38:46.480 --> 38:47.710
-How about spicy and sour rice noodles?
-Boss.

38:47.710 --> 38:49.190
Your speech today

38:49.320 --> 38:51.070
was truly "molecular"!

38:51.840 --> 38:53.410
You mean spectacular.

38:58.990 --> 39:00.920
I guess it's Ms. Gui Lili.

39:01.080 --> 39:02.210
That's impossible.

39:03.790 --> 39:05.290
[Gui Lili]

39:04.390 --> 39:06.010
It really is Gui Lili.

39:08.270 --> 39:09.370
Impressive.

39:10.000 --> 39:12.190
You know her so well.

39:12.210 --> 39:14.270
It shows you still haven't let her go.

39:15.710 --> 39:17.260
It's not about knowing her.

39:17.320 --> 39:18.890
I just know women.

39:20.000 --> 39:20.710
Come on.

39:21.320 --> 39:22.670
You don't know me.

39:22.880 --> 39:23.440
Really?

39:24.550 --> 39:26.070
Is it possible

39:27.030 --> 39:28.760
that you don't count as a woman?

39:30.330 --> 39:31.210
Just kidding.

39:34.840 --> 39:36.440
Since you know women so well,

39:36.550 --> 39:37.680
guess what she said.

39:38.760 --> 39:39.480
Qian Fei,

39:40.110 --> 39:42.430
how is Yifei doing recently?

39:41.120 --> 39:42.480
[Qian Fei, how is Yifei doing recently?]

39:47.220 --> 39:48.640
Just tell me if I'm right.

39:50.240 --> 39:51.700
I guessed right, didn't I?

39:52.280 --> 39:52.930
A three.

39:54.440 --> 39:54.960
Beat that.

39:54.960 --> 39:55.490
Qian Fei,

39:55.550 --> 39:57.150
-has Yifei ever...
-So big?

39:57.150 --> 39:58.270
mentioned me to you?

39:58.270 --> 39:58.940
Qian Fei?

40:00.980 --> 40:02.240
[Qian Fei,
has Yifei ever mentioned me to you?]

40:02.260 --> 40:02.650
[No.]

40:03.910 --> 40:05.310
What are you waiting for?

40:05.330 --> 40:06.190
It's your turn.

40:07.400 --> 40:08.480
Stop chatting.

40:08.480 --> 40:09.880
Here, let me do it for you.

40:10.250 --> 40:11.310
I'll reply for you.

40:12.970 --> 40:14.050
Let me.

40:14.340 --> 40:15.190
Qian Fei, do you have

40:14.480 --> 40:15.260
[No.]

40:15.190 --> 40:16.630
a crush on Li Yifei?

40:15.280 --> 40:16.220
[Qian Fei,
do you have a crush on Li Yifei?]

40:16.250 --> 40:17.360
[Is that why
you're not telling me the truth?]

40:16.790 --> 40:19.190
Is that why
you're not telling me the truth?

40:19.190 --> 40:21.590
Boss, I think I smell some gossip.

40:21.610 --> 40:22.830
Sit back down.

40:23.090 --> 40:24.750
I'll let you win a round later.

40:27.070 --> 40:29.030
Having a crush on him
is not a weird thing.

40:29.030 --> 40:30.690
He is pretty handsome.

40:31.000 --> 40:32.920
He buys groceries, washes dishes,
and does chores.

40:32.920 --> 40:35.030
He wears whatever clothes you buy him.

40:35.030 --> 40:36.170
He looks handsome in anything,

40:36.170 --> 40:37.710
and even more handsome wearing nothing.

40:37.710 --> 40:38.670
With such a captivating person

40:38.670 --> 40:40.440
wandering around you every day,

40:40.440 --> 40:41.860
who wouldn't like him?

40:42.030 --> 40:42.930
What are you sending?

40:42.930 --> 40:44.130
What are you sending?

40:45.030 --> 40:45.920
Stop it.

40:50.220 --> 40:51.370
[Gui Lili]

40:50.690 --> 40:51.600
Li Yifei,

40:52.170 --> 40:54.370
why are you sending such flirty tildes?

40:54.710 --> 40:55.550
Have some shame, will you?

40:55.550 --> 40:56.030
It's between you two.

40:56.030 --> 40:57.510
Why drag me into it?

40:58.230 --> 40:58.800
Also,

40:59.630 --> 41:01.600
will you die if you don't act crazy

41:01.630 --> 41:02.800
and praise yourself every day?

41:02.800 --> 41:04.910
I'm rescuing you. Don't you get it?

41:05.070 --> 41:06.130
You have to let her know

41:06.130 --> 41:07.860
that you got me to do what she

41:07.880 --> 41:09.510
asked me to do back then but I didn't do.

41:09.510 --> 41:12.230
Let's see if she still has the courage
to reply to you.

41:12.230 --> 41:13.000
And the most important thing is,

41:13.000 --> 41:14.320
she is interrupting our card game.

41:14.320 --> 41:15.070
Understand?

41:15.090 --> 41:16.760
Your turn, lady.

41:16.880 --> 41:18.110
Yeah, hurry up.

41:18.660 --> 41:21.350
Come on, you're just bitter.

41:21.380 --> 41:24.240
You're upset
that she cheated on you and dumped you.

41:25.710 --> 41:26.280
Pass.

41:27.280 --> 41:27.840
Pass.

41:33.870 --> 41:34.410
She...

41:34.920 --> 41:35.710
She replied?

41:39.430 --> 41:40.360
It really is her?

41:41.000 --> 41:43.110
Qian Fei, I sincerely advise you

41:43.110 --> 41:44.360
not to fall too deep,

41:44.360 --> 41:45.920
so you won't get hurt badly in the future.

41:45.920 --> 41:47.630
People should have self-awareness.

41:47.630 --> 41:49.610
Yifei wouldn't like a woman like you.

41:49.610 --> 41:52.000
She dared to reply?
Let me see what she said.

41:52.000 --> 41:52.550
Let me see.

41:52.550 --> 41:54.010
Give it to me. Give it to me!

42:00.230 --> 42:01.480
Where is my Big Joker?

42:02.690 --> 42:04.150
Where did the Big Joker go?

42:04.510 --> 42:05.770
Did I leave it outside?

42:15.480 --> 42:16.630
What did she say?

42:19.070 --> 42:20.420
She said you snore in your sleep.

42:20.420 --> 42:20.790
I...

42:21.920 --> 42:22.800
Impossible!

42:23.000 --> 42:24.550
I never snore in my sleep.

42:26.360 --> 42:26.760
I...

42:28.110 --> 42:28.760
Found it.

42:29.510 --> 42:30.770
I left it in the office.

42:34.440 --> 42:35.900
Play your cards, Qian Fei.

42:45.070 --> 42:46.030
Pass.

42:50.410 --> 42:51.450
-Pass.
-Pass.

42:52.180 --> 42:53.770
[In the next episode
of "Love Has Fireworks"]

42:54.110 --> 42:55.810
If you ever dare

42:55.830 --> 42:57.800
make me wash vegetables for you again,

42:57.800 --> 42:58.740
you'll bear

42:59.280 --> 43:00.340
the consequences.

43:01.170 --> 43:02.670
When I was washing clothes,

43:02.670 --> 43:04.360
I came out and saw

43:04.360 --> 43:05.710
that the washing machine...

43:05.710 --> 43:06.110
It was nothing.

43:06.110 --> 43:07.710
Just a little water overflowed.

43:07.710 --> 43:09.240
What do you mean by a little?

43:09.320 --> 43:10.910
Not much.

43:10.940 --> 43:12.740
It just reached the living room.

43:13.030 --> 43:14.440
-Wait. Let me explain.
-I hate you!

43:14.440 --> 43:15.790
Listen to me!

43:16.020 --> 43:17.880
Don't put on that miserable look.

43:18.000 --> 43:19.060
I'll tell you what.

43:19.070 --> 43:19.760
From now on,

43:20.440 --> 43:21.880
I'll let you play out

43:21.880 --> 43:23.040
your trust fund baby dreams
in front of me.

43:23.040 --> 43:23.890
Is that okay?
